WEBVTT

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.793
AG: It is amazing because
you see her, you see the guy,

00:01:33.817 --> 00:01:35.294
and then there's just a potato.

00:01:35.318 --> 00:01:36.828
LO: (Laughs) Yes.

00:01:36.852 --> 00:01:40.516
AG: (Laughs) Yeah, this poor potato
is like, "How do I stop being a potato?"

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:42.612
LO: Forty million people have seen it,

00:01:42.636 --> 00:01:44.946
and it's become sort of a cultural moment

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:49.146
in this quarantine world
that we're in right now.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.606
AG: You have a new identity now,
don't you, though?

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.976
LO: That's true. I'm known
to the world as "potato boss."

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.806
I have potato appearances
requests (Laughs) --

00:01:58.830 --> 00:01:59.991
AG: (Laughs)